You are continuing development of the existing **Pixel Art Aquarium Idle Tycoon / Ecosystem Tycoon mobile game**.

This is an ADDITIONAL GAMEPLAY EXPANSION.

Do NOT rebuild the project from scratch.

Do NOT remove existing systems.

Preserve the existing:

- Fish system
- Fish growth
